{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09996","headline":"戏赠歌者 · 梁鍠","name":"戏赠歌者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白皙歌童子，哀音绝又连。\n楚妃临扇学，卢女隔帘传。\n晓燕喧喉里，春莺啭舌边。\n若逢汉武帝，还是李延年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁鍠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}